# @name listAuditEvents
### List the latest audit events (ROLE_ADMIN)
GET {{apiUrl}}/audit-events?limit=20
Accept: application/ld+json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

> {%
    client.test("Status code is 200 OK", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, "Expected 200 OK");
    });
%}

###

# @name listAuditEventsForHolder
### Audit events of the holder registered by holders/post.http
GET {{apiUrl}}/audit-events?subjectId={{holderId}}
Accept: application/ld+json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

> {%
    client.test("Status code is 200 OK", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, "Expected 200 OK");
    });
%}
